 class="small-icon"/><p>Youtube</p></a></div></div><div id="w-node-_2c5a1ea0-f360-e011-514c-b58e4f58aba8-4f58ab7e" class="col align-items-stretch"><div id="newsletter" class="bottom-margin-1-5em padding-left-0"><h5>Subscribe to our Newsletter</h5></div><div><div class="form-block w-form"><form method="post" fs-formsubmit-element="form" name="wf-form-Subscribe-Form" data-name="Subscribe Form" id="wf-form-Subscribe-Form" fs-formsubmit-enhance="true" class="grid" data-wf-page-id="64a8bfaf6620ae4bee334444" data-wf-element-id="5134e183-602b-7897-5e4f-d859487761f8" data-turnstile-sitekey="0x4AAAAAAAQTptj2So4dx43e"><div class="hide"><input class="user-ip w-input" maxlength="256" name="User-Ip-3" data-name="User Ip 3" placeholder="e.g. John" type="text" id="User-Ip-3"/><input class="current-date w-input" maxlength="256" name="Current-Date" data-name="Current Date" placeholder="e.g. John" type="text" id="Current-Date-2"/></div><div id="w-node-_5134e183-602b-7897-5e4f-d859487761f9-4f58ab7e" class="field-wrapper"><label for="firstname" class="field-label">First Name*</label><input class="footer-text-field bg-darker w-input" maxlength="256" name="firstname" data-name="firstname" placeholder="e.g. John" type="text" id="firstname" required=""/></div><div id="w-node-_5134e183-602b-7897-5e4f-d859487761fd-4f58ab7e" class="field-wrapper"><label for="lastname" class="field-label">Last Name*</label><input class="footer-text-field bg-darker w-input" maxlength="256" name="lastname" data-name="lastname" placeholder="e.g. Smith" type="text" id="lastname" required=""/></div><div id="w-node-_5134e183-602b-7897-5e4f-d85948776201-4f58ab7e" class="field-wrapper"><label for="email" class="field-label">Email*</label><input class="footer-text-field bg-darker w-input" maxlength="256" name="email" data-name="email" placeholder="e.g. john@company.com.au" type="email" id="email" required=""/></div><div id="w-node-_5134e183-602b-7897-5e4f-d85948776205-4f58ab7e" class="field-wrapper"><label for="phone" class="field-label">Phone</label><input class="footer-text-field bg-darker w-input" maxlength="256" name="phone" data-name="phone" placeholder="e.g. 0400 000 000" type="tel" id="phone"/></div><div id="w-node-_5134e183-602b-7897-5e4f-d85948776209-4f58ab7e" class="field-wrapper"><label for="favourite_team" class="field-label">Favourite Team?</label><select id="favourite_team" name="favourite_team" data-name="favourite_team" class="footer-text-field bg-darker _300-text-colour w-select"><option value="">Select one...</option><option value="Adelaide 36ers">Adelaide 36ers</option><option value="Brisbane Bullets">Brisbane Bullets</option><option value="Cairns Taipans">Cairns Taipans</option><option value="Illawarra Hawks">Illawarra Hawks</option><option value="Melbourne United">Melbourne United</option><option value="New Zealand Breakers">New Zealand Breakers</option><option value="Perth Wildcats">Perth Wildcats</option><option value="SE Melbourne Phoenix">SE Melbourne Phoenix</option><option value="Sydney Kings">Sydney Kings</option><option value="Tasmania JackJumpers">Tasmania JackJumpers</option></select></div><div id="w-node-_5134e183-602b-7897-5e4f-d8594877620d-4f58ab7e" class="newsletter-footer"><div id="w-node-_5134e183-602b-7897-5e4f-d8594877620e-4f58ab7e" class="field-wrapper"><label class="w-checkbox checkbox-wrapper-copy"><input type="checkbox" name="Agree-to-TC-Privacy-Policy-2" id="Agree-to-TC-Privacy-Policy-2" data-name="Agree To TC Privacy Policy 2" required="" class="w-checkbox-input"/><span class="checkbox-label small-paragraph font-siz-0-85em font-weight700 w-form-label" for="Agree-to-TC-Privacy-Policy-2">I agree to the NBL <a href="/pages/nbl-experience-terms-and-conditions">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> and <a href="/pages/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.</span></label></div><input type="submit" data-wait="Please wait..." id="w-node-_5134e183-602b-7897-5e4f-d85948776219-4f58ab7e" class="button submit-btn w-button" value="Subscribe"/></div></form><div class="success-message-2 w-form-done"><div class="success-message-center"><div class="small-paragraph">Thank you! Your submission has been received!</div></div></div><div class="error-message w-form-fail"><div class="error-message-center"><div class="small-paragraph">Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-embed w-script"><script>
function isTopAligned(el, offset = 0, tolerance = 5) {
  const rect = el.getBoundingClientRect();
  return Math.abs(rect.top - offset) <= tolerance;
}

function scrollToHashWithOffset() {
  const hash = window.location.hash;
  if (!hash) return;

  const el = document.querySelector(hash);
  if (!el) return;

  const isMobile = window.innerWidth <= 768;
  const offset = isMobile ? 75 : 0;

  if (isTopAligned(el, offset)) return;

  const y =
    el.getBoundingClientRect().top +
    window.pageYOffset -
    offset;

  window.scrollTo({
    top: y,
    behavior: "smooth",
  });
}

// ✅ Wait until .page-transition is gone or hidden
function waitForTransitionThenScroll() {
  const transition = document.querySelector(".page-transition");

  // If it doesn't exist → scroll immediately
  if (!transition) {
    scrollToHashWithOffset();
    return;
  }

  const isHidden = () => {
    const style = window.getComputedStyle(transition);
    return style.display === "none";
  };

  // If already hidden → scroll
  if (isHidden()) {
    scrollToHashWithOffset();
    return;
  }

  // Otherwise observe until it disappears or hides
  const observer = new MutationObserver(() => {
    if (!document.body.contains(transition) || isHidden()) {
      observer.disconnect();
      scrollToHashWithOffset();
    }
  });

  observer.observe(document.body, {
    childList: true,
    subtree: true,
    attributes: true,
    attributeFilter: ["style", "class"]
  });
}

// Wait for full load + layout
window.addEventListener("load", () => {
  requestAnimationFrame(() => {
    requestAnimationFrame(() => {
      waitForTransitionThenScroll();
    });
  });
});
</script></div></div></div><div class="disclaimer-wrapper"><div class="w-layout-grid grid footer-section-grid font-size-085em"><div id="w-node-_2c5a1ea0-f360-e011-514c-b58e4f58abcb-4f58ab7e" class="col align-items-stretch"><div class="acknowledge-wrapper"><a href="/old-home" class="link-block-2 w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64a4f0de3648103ab3295afa/66bde14559b9ff958bc1fe50_NBL-HJ_Logo_NEW_Horizontal.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="ignite-cup-wrapper"/></a><p class="small-paragraph _300-text-colour">The National Basketball League acknowledges the Traditional Custodians of the lands on which we work, live &amp; play. We pay our respects to their Elders past, present &amp; emerging as well as all Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander Community.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_2c5a1ea0-f360-e011-514c-b58e4f58abd0-4f58ab7e" class="col align-items-stretch"><div class="w-layout-grid grid disclaimer-grid"><div id="w-node-_2c5a1ea0-f360-e011-514c-b58e4f58abd2-4f58ab7e" class="col"><a id="w-node-_2c5a1ea0-f360-e011-514c-b58e4f58abe2-4f58ab7e" href="/alumni" class="footer-link w-inline-block"><p class="small-paragraph">Alumni</p></a><a id="w-node-_2c5a1ea0-f360-e011-514c-b58e4f58abd4-4f58ab7e" href="/board-of-directors" class="footer-link w-inline-block"><p class="small-paragraph _300-text-colour">Board of Directors</p></a><a id="w-node-_2c5a1ea0-f360-e011-514c-b58e4f58abd7-4f58ab7e" href="/contact-us" class="footer-link w-inline-block"><p class="small-paragraph _300-text-colour">Contact Us</p></a></div><div id="w-node-_2c5a1ea0-f360-e011-514c-b58e4f58abdd-4f58ab7e" class="col"><a id="w-node-_2c5a1ea0-f360-e011-514c-b58e4f58abda-4f58ab7e" href="/pages/nbl-corporate-social-responsibility-statement" class="footer-link w-inline-block"><p class="small-paragraph _300-text-colour">CSR Statement</p></a><a id="w-node-_2c5a1ea0-f360-e011-514c-b58e4f58abdf-4f58ab7e" href="/executive-team" class="footer-link w-inline-block"><p class="small-paragraph _300-text-colour">Executive Team</p></a><a href="/auth/sign-in" target="_blank" class="footer-link w-inline-block"><p class="small-paragraph _300-text-colour">NBL +</p></a></div><div id="w-node-_2c5a1ea0-f360-e011-514c-b58e4f58abe8-4f58ab7e" class="col"><a href="/pages/privacy-policy" class="footer-link w-inline-block"><p class="small-paragraph _300-text-colour">Privacy Policy</p></a><a id="w-node-_2c5a1ea0-f360-e011-514c-b58e4f58abed-4f58ab7e" href="/pages/nbl-experience-terms-and-conditions" class="footer-link w-inline-block"><p class="small-paragraph _300-text-colour">Terms &amp; Conditions</p></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bg _500-bg bg-black"></div></footer></main><script src="https://d3e54v103j8qbb.cloudfront.net/js/jquery-3.5.1.min.dc5e7f18c8.js?site=64a4f0de3648103ab3295afa" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha256-9/aliU8dGd2tb6OSsuzixeV4y/faTqgFtohetphbbj0=" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64a4f0de3648103ab3295afa/js/nblaus.655744e4.29a877ed97837adc.js" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha384-Gb2E6sauWaQwbZiSjNavJ2TseNfuUHJ6ir68Z/rJoQLRELl7NhdzXfTVYADNo+Rq" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><!-- Dynamic Copyright Year -->
